CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjBlockCounter "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Block Counter 
前雷达目标物前言：块计数值";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountPosX "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount Position X Direction
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在X方向安装位置
mount offset of sensor in longitudinal direction relative to rear axis of vehicle";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountPosY "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount Position Y Direction
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在Y方向安装位置
mount offset of sensor in lateral direction relative to mid axis of vehicle";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountPosZ "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount Position Z Direction
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在Z方向安装位置
mount offset of sensor in elevation direction relative to GROUND";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountAngleYaw "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount AngleYaw
前雷达目标物前言：雷达安装位置偏航角
angle between sensor mounting direction(boresight direction) and vehicle longitudinal axis, Azimuth";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountAnglePitch "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount Angle Pitch
前雷达目标物前言：雷达安装位置俯仰角
angle between sensor mounting direction(boresight direction) and vehicle longitudinal axis, Elevation";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MountAngleRoll "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Mount Angle Roll
前雷达目标物前言：雷达安装倾斜角
Tilt of the mounting sensor";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_AlignAglYawErrCurr "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Alignment AngleYaw Erro Current
前雷达目标物前言：雷达当前校准的偏航角误差
Current sensor mounting azimuth angle error by auto-alignment";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_AlignAglYawErrEOL "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Alignment AngleYaw Erro EOL
前雷达目标物前言：雷达产线校准的偏航角误差
Recorded sensor mounting azimuth angle error by EOL-alignment";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_AlignAglPitchErrEOL "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Alignment Angle Pitch Erro EOL
前雷达目标物前言：雷达产线校准的俯仰角误差
Recorded sensor mounting elevation angle error by EOL-alignment";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_FOVYawAglLower "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Field Of View Yaw Angle Lower
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在偏航方向上的下视场角
Lower angle of the fied of view Azimuth";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_FOVYawAglUpper "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Field Of View Yaw Angle Upper
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在偏航方向上的上视场角
Upper angle of the field of view Azimuth based on sensro boresight direction";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_FOVPitchAglLower "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Field Of View Pitch Angle Lower
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在俯仰方向上的下视场
Lower angle of the fied of view Elevation based on sensro boresight direction";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_FOVPitchAglUpper "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Field Of View Pitch Angle Upper
前雷达目标物前言：雷达在俯仰方向上的上视场
Upper angle of the field of view Elevation based on sensro boresight direction";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_MaxDetectionRange "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Maximun Detection Range
前雷达目标物前言：雷达最大探测范围
Estimated detection range of the sensor";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_HWFail "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Hardware Fail
前雷达目标物前言：雷达硬件故障
Flag To Indicate If Sensor Hardware Failure Is Exist Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_Misalignment "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Misalignment
前雷达目标物前言：雷达失校准
Flag To Indicate If Alignment Out Of Spec";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_AlignmentNotDone "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Alignment Not Done
前雷达目标物前言：雷达未校准
Flag To Indicate if Alignment Has Been Done or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_SensorBlockage "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Sensor Blockage
前雷达目标物前言：雷达被遮挡
Flag To Indicate If Sensor Is Blind Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjDetFail "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Detection Fail
前雷达目标物前言：雷达目标探测失效
Indicates An Error In The Object Detection System. This flag include all conditions that shall impact radar detection performance, like HWFailure, Misalignment, AlignmentNotDone, SensorBlockage, OutOfVoltage, OverTemperature, ReceivedCANTimeOut, ReceivedCANInvalid, RF-BoardNoWorking.";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_OutOfVoltage "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Out Of Voltage
前雷达目标物前言：雷达电压超范围
Indicates An Error Of Over Or Under Voltage";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_OverTemperature "Front Radar Moudle_1_Detection Header_Over Temperature
前雷达目标物前言：雷达温度过高
Indicates An Error Of Over Temperature";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ReceivedCANTimeOut "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Received CAN Time Out
前雷达目标物前言：雷达接收CAN信号超时
Flag To Indicate If Received CAN Signal Time Out Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ReceivedCANInvalid "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Received CAN Invalid
前雷达目标物前言：雷达接收到无效CAN信号
Flag To Indicate If Received CAN Signal Invalid Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_RFBoardWorkingSts "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Radial Frequency Board Working Status
前雷达目标物前言：雷达射频板工作状态
Flag To Indicate Sensor RF Board Working Or Not. This flag shall set to 0x1 NoWokring only when RF Board power cutted off via UDS command actively. RF Board failure shall not set this flag.";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ValidObjCount "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Valid Object Count
前雷达目标物前言：雷达有效目标物数量
number of detected VALID Objects that have been sent to the bus";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjDownSel "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Down Select
前雷达目标物前言：雷达目标物输出达到上限
the detected number of objects exceeded the number of max. objects that can be transmitted";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjTimeStamp "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Time Stamp
前雷达目标物前言：目标物的时间戳
Captured time of object based on local time base of FRM which is synchronized by global time periodically";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjTimeStampSts "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Time Stamp Status
前雷达目标物前言：目标物时间戳状态
Autosar StbM_TimeBaseStatusType bitfield
Bit 0: TIMEOUT
Bit 1: SYNC_TO_GATEWAY
Bit 2: GLOBAL_TIME_BASE
Bit 3: TIMELEAP_FUTURE
Bit 4: TIMELEAP_PAST";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ObjTimeLatency "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Object Time Latency
前雷达目标物前言：目标物时间延迟
Sensor latency from object capture scene to object transmission";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_NotConfigured "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Not Configured
前雷达目标物前言：雷达未配置
Flag To Indicate If Radar Configured Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 960 FRM_1_ObjHd_ParameterInvalid "Front Radar Moudle_1_Object Header_Parameter Invalid
前雷达目标物前言：雷达参数无效
